            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "description": "dcms.edge.request, counted in the edge's own middleware rather than taken from the ASP.NET Core HTTP metrics, because those carry no hostname and the hostname is the whole of what this edge routes on. `or vector(0)` so an edge serving nothing reads as zero instead of \"No data\", which is indistinguishable from a broken query."
