      "description": "admin.highgeek.eu, platform.highgeek.eu, grafana.highgeek.eu, git.highgeek.eu, and every tenant custom domain served by the catch-all route. The `host` tag is the SNI/Host name the client asked for, so a domain appearing here that no tenant owns is someone pointing their DNS at us -- which is also what the TLS allow-list refuses to issue for.",
